{"4604690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INURE", "steam_appid": 4604690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5003510], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person cosmic survival horror experience built around tactile world interaction, limited resources, and a descent into a reality that should not exist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Marc Whitecloud is investigating the unexplained disappearance of 28 people when an unexpected lead pulls him into the Dreamlands–a hostile, dreamlike space where the rules of reality no longer hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE DESCENT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/341488a018f420b77fea2599937cb937.poster.avif?t=1787907383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/341488a018f420b77fea2599937cb937.webm?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/341488a018f420b77fea2599937cb937.mp4?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted horror experience where beauty and dread exist side by side. Search for clues and push deeper into a world that can be breathtaking one moment and deeply wrong the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOUCH THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/d7d50e031cd1bbd46ccda86c78113fd4.poster.avif?t=1787907383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/d7d50e031cd1bbd46ccda86c78113fd4.webm?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/d7d50e031cd1bbd46ccda86c78113fd4.mp4?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment through a physics-driven system that makes the world feel tangible. Lift, drag, inspect,  and manipulate objects by hand. Ease doors open, move obstacles, and use nearby objects to interrupt threats, buy space, and stay in control of the fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE EVERY SLOT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/9fd49ba262abd3e0ae486b8dc75fa2d1.poster.avif?t=1787907383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/9fd49ba262abd3e0ae486b8dc75fa2d1.webm?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/9fd49ba262abd3e0ae486b8dc75fa2d1.mp4?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space is limited, so every item matters. Keep your inventory under control, ration healing and supplies, and craft useful consumables from the resources you find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT WHEN YOU MUST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/7e3addbd40a23adc5ba53ff8909de02d.poster.avif?t=1787907383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/7e3addbd40a23adc5ba53ff8909de02d.webm?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/7e3addbd40a23adc5ba53ff8909de02d.mp4?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find weapons and ammunition to defend yourself, but survival is never guaranteed by firepower alone. Every shot matters, and not every threat is meant to be faced head-on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal Dreamlands setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based environmental interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited-slot survival-horror inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consumable crafting, scarce ammo, and healing supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused, handcrafted 2–3 hour campaign.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person cosmic survival horror experience built around tactile world interaction, limited resources, and a descent into a reality that should not exist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Marc Whitecloud is investigating the unexplained disappearance of 28 people when an unexpected lead pulls him into the Dreamlands–a hostile, dreamlike space where the rules of reality no longer hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE DESCENT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/341488a018f420b77fea2599937cb937.poster.avif?t=1787907383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/341488a018f420b77fea2599937cb937.webm?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/341488a018f420b77fea2599937cb937.mp4?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted horror experience where beauty and dread exist side by side. Search for clues and push deeper into a world that can be breathtaking one moment and deeply wrong the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOUCH THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/d7d50e031cd1bbd46ccda86c78113fd4.poster.avif?t=1787907383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/d7d50e031cd1bbd46ccda86c78113fd4.webm?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/d7d50e031cd1bbd46ccda86c78113fd4.mp4?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment through a physics-driven system that makes the world feel tangible. Lift, drag, inspect,  and manipulate objects by hand. Ease doors open, move obstacles, and use nearby objects to interrupt threats, buy space, and stay in control of the fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE EVERY SLOT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/9fd49ba262abd3e0ae486b8dc75fa2d1.poster.avif?t=1787907383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/9fd49ba262abd3e0ae486b8dc75fa2d1.webm?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/9fd49ba262abd3e0ae486b8dc75fa2d1.mp4?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space is limited, so every item matters. Keep your inventory under control, ration healing and supplies, and craft useful consumables from the resources you find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT WHEN YOU MUST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/7e3addbd40a23adc5ba53ff8909de02d.poster.avif?t=1787907383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/7e3addbd40a23adc5ba53ff8909de02d.webm?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/extras/7e3addbd40a23adc5ba53ff8909de02d.mp4?t=1787907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find weapons and ammunition to defend yourself, but survival is never guaranteed by firepower alone. Every shot matters, and not every threat is meant to be faced head-on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal Dreamlands setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based environmental interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited-slot survival-horror inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consumable crafting, scarce ammo, and healing supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused, handcrafted 2–3 hour campaign.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Wrong man, in the wrong place, at the wrong time. Explore a hostile Dreamscape, manage scarce resources, and use whatever weapons you can find to survive a world shaped by cosmic dread.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/c5f5f11109dfbb0eba20499a8df85e6b2c0a6913/header.jpg?t=1787907383", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/731ba7712f906ba6fd5427b814eeb9ea0a19ed3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787907383", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604690/731ba7712f906ba6fd5427b814eeb9ea0a19ed3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787907383", "website": "https://impress.games/press-kit/koolkat/inure", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-6600 Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 580 / GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System requirements are not final and will be updated in the future!</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended